UID:e24718129c24e6a25b99afe0800a1fbe0b2275d08cc7e90e42cef8e2efc7357e@edsby
 _ai_sync
SEQUENCE:1790596989
DESCRIPTION:PHYSICAL EDUCATION/HEALTH 40F\n\n地点安排带有条件，
 请按原公告核对，不能视为无条件更换教室。\n体育与健
 康40F课程：PAP活动日志Excel表格的官方开始周。请在使用
 SAMPLE 1标签开始记录，使用SAMPLE 2标签。文件已通过OneDriv
 e共享，请勿保存，直接在OneDrive中编辑。确保遵循要求
 以获得每周“完成”评价，否则需在学期末补做。\n\n公
 告原文：\nPHYSICAL EDUCATION/HEALTH 40F Hello again class. I have just
  sent you all your PAP Log Excel - Please try and open it and to make sure
  I gave you EDIT permission on it. You can start to log ASAP for this comi
 ng week under the SAMPLE 1 tab - then next week use the SAMPLE 2 tab. This
  has been sent as a ONE DRIVE. Remember DO NOT save it. Just open in One D
 rive to edit as it is a LIVE document. The official start date is Oct 19th
  Week. This then gives you 2 weeks of opportunity to use the excel and to 
 make sure you are following my expectations what is needed to earn a COMPL
 ETE each week. Otherwise they become INCOMPLETE and you will be making it 
 up in a MAKE UP DAY near the end of the semester. So make sure to work on 
 these over the next two week. Thx Mr. D
